{
  "name": "Train a Transformer classifier on MNIST",
  "description": "16 image tokens, then test accuracy; needs a download",
  "gallery": { "section": "training", "order": 3 },
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -570,
        "y": 200
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "A Transformer used as an image classifier, to show that attention is not tied to text. Each image becomes a sequence of 16 tokens, four decoder blocks attend over them, and a linear head reads out 10 class scores.\n\nAfter a run, watch the loss curve fall and read the test accuracy Print. Three epochs reach about 96%: attention over invented tokens does not beat convolution on images, and a model this small is not meant to.\n\nThe first run downloads MNIST into backend/data. Three epochs take a few minutes on a CPU. Open the SequentialModel layer editor to change d_model, num_layers or the head count.\n\n這是把 Transformer 當成影像分類器用，說明注意力機制不是文字專屬的。每張影像會變成一段 16 個 token 的序列，四層 decoder 對它們做注意力，最後由一層線性層讀出 10 個類別分數。\n\n跑完之後看損失曲線下降，並讀測試準確率的 Print。三個 epoch 大約到 96%：在影像上，對自己造出來的 token 做注意力贏不過卷積，而這麼小的模型本來也不是為了贏。\n\n第一次執行會把 MNIST 下載到 backend/data。3 個 epoch 在 CPU 上約數分鐘。打開 SequentialModel 的層編輯器可以改 d_model、num_layers 或頭數。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start-1",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-model-builder",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 50,
        "y": -130
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "Flatten turns the 28x28 image into 784 numbers, Linear projects those to 384, and Reshape reads the 384 as 16 tokens of 24 dims. That is the whole trick: there is no text here, the sequence is invented. d_model has to stay equal to the token width, 24.\n\nFlatten 把 28x28 的影像攤成 784 個數字，Linear 投影成 384，Reshape 再把這 384 個數字讀成 16 個 24 維的 token。訣竅就只有這樣：這裡沒有文字，序列是自己造出來的。d_model 必須等於 token 寬度 24。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "model-builder",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": -330
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    },
